      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. the water thing is helping a bit but it's still stinging so much. i don't have any aloe or burn cream in the house right now though. my mom always said that putting a thick layer of heavy cream or even some vegetable oil on it helps seal it up and stops the air from hitting it so it doesn't sting as much. is that okay to do just for now until i can get to a store? it seems like it would help more than just water.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
